# Cloudflare Pages serves index.html with a 200 for unknown paths, which turns every
# dead link into a soft-404 that Google indexes as a duplicate homepage. 404.html fixes
# the general case; these two rules preserve the specific URLs that used to be real
# project pages, so anything already linking to them lands on the work index instead.
/head-boy-application.html  /work.html  301
/f1-abu-dhabi-2024.html     /work.html  301
/weddings.html              /events.html  301
